axation", "【 4-Position Rotary Switch 】Operate via a convenient rotary switch: Choose between the main lamp (full brightness for tasks), floral night light (ultra-dim for sleep comfort), or both layers simultane", "【63\" Ideal Height 】Stands at 63 inches tall (160 cm), optimally illuminating most spaces. —perfect height for eye-comfort glow whether seated or standing.", "【Low-Maintenance Resin Build | Water-Resistant & Easy Clean】High-quality resin construction (not real wood) retains handcrafted wood aesthetics with zero upkeep. Water-resistant, warp-proof, and wipe-"]}, "B0952SGJK9": {"rating": 4.6, "reviews": 334, "bullets": ["Extra Large King Size 2 Person Double Hammock: The bed of ROOITY hammock is 95\" x 60\", compared to the previous generation hammock, this one is longer and wider. The total length is 137 inches/350cm (", "Comfortable and High Quality Construction: This ROOITY hammock is made of high colorfast density thickened cotton fabric, providing soft, breathable and skin-friendly comfort for relaxation. The sturd", "Heavy Duty Weight Capacity Up To 450 Lbs: The handcrafted knots at both ends and solid fabric are strong enough to hold up to 450 lbs. It is safe for two average adults, kids and pets to relax or take", "Portable and Easy To Set Up: The hammock comes with a drawstring carrying bag and 78-inch tied rope. It folds into a compact size when packed up, making it very convenient for storage or to carry. Set", "Versatile Outdoor and Indoor Use: ROOITY hammock is used for swinging, sleeping, or resting and serves as a lightweight bed on camping trips. The hammock represents summer, leisure, relaxation and sim"]}, "B0BCXF3T1W": {"rating": 4.0, "reviews": 131, "bullets": ["Battery/playtime: 22+ hours of wireless Bluetooth 5 playtime keeps kids gaming all day, plus an included AUX cord for wired backup when the battery runs low.", "Volume safety: Built-in volume limiting at 85dB protects young ears during long gaming sessions, so parents can feel co